This is an AI test tube racking robot. I am going to use cheap robotic arms like SO-101/ elephant robotics/ Scara along with a powerful AI model that I will train to pick and place a test tube into a test tube rack. I aim to teach the robot arm for multiple hours by hand, and with the help of issac sim, hopefully allow scientists to do more tests while not having to worry about the tedius work of test tube racking by hand. I will use a 3d printer to print an enclosure using plastic extrusions, along with acrylic and 3d printed funnels for input and output. This robot will cleanly pick up test tubes from a box and file them into neat rows without human intervention.
